      "value": "THANK YOU! It's such a struggle trying to communicate through VRchat, especially if there are misunderstandings. It doesn't help trying to message people through Discord either because sometimes people just don't check their DMs when they're on VR (I'm guilty of this). It'd save a lot of hassle.",
