  "details": "I want to be able to send a \"Reply\" without having to receive an invite first.\n\nI want to be able to reply to a reply.\n\nI've seen some suggestions of an in-game messaging system, and I really think this is the way to do it.\n\nAdd a new button next to invite and request invite that says message. then allow people to use the system already in place for replies to send a message.\n\nAllow people to reply to the message. allow people to reply to a reply.",
